<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Japan 50 · Bench (saved, not slotted)</name><Style id="idea"><IconStyle><color>ff00d7ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/ylw-stars.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
<Folder><name>Tokyo — Food &amp; Drink</name>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>Yakiniku Coco Nemaru Ginza</name><description>Wagyu yakiniku (grill at table). No free Tokyo dinner left; swap candidate for the Dec 13 Sushi Yuu night. Private rooms. 1 min from Ginza Stn Exit C3.</description><Point><coordinates>139.7612311,35.6717064,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>The SG Club</name><description>Top cocktail bar, Shibuya. Opens 6 PM. Nightcap spot.</description><Point><coordinates>139.69923140000003,35.6642434,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>Sushi Punch</name><description>Omakase sushi, Azabujuban 7F. Book ahead. Closed Sundays.</description><Point><coordinates>139.7357535,35.653654599999996,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>Yoroniku Ebisu</name><description>Wagyu yakiniku omakase. Reservation-only, book ~1 month out. Overlaps w/ Coco Nemaru — pick one.</description><Point><coordinates>139.71180569999999,35.646357099999996,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>Uonami Fish Bar</name><description>Retro izakaya, Toshima. Out of the way + seafood overlap — low priority. Closed Mondays.</description><Point><coordinates>139.6952222,35.726608899999995,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>Good Wood Terrace</name><description>Caribbean jerk chicken, Shibuya (viral after Kanye). Novelty pick. 2-19-3 Dogenzaka.</description><Point><coordinates>139.6935,35.6578,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Kyoto</name>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>KUOE Kyoto (optional)</name><description>Build-your-own watch. ~2 min walk from Hotel Resol; 11-5:30, closed Tue. Drop in if a Kyoto gap opens.</description><Point><coordinates>135.76682,35.00851,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Osaka</name>
<Placemark><styleUrl>#idea</styleUrl><name>Sennichimae Doguyasuji</name><description>Kitchenware street. Skipped: closes 6 PM and Kappabashi (Tokyo, Nov 29) already covers knives + fake food.</description><Point><coordinates>135.5035063,34.664014099999996,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
